{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "方", "id": "方"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "界", "id": "界"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "行", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 2.8088549002241754, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.3096301881366648, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "行", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 2.344549292093078, "source": "行", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 1.9233358270167742, "source": "界", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.6164830075767194, "source": "界", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 4.00277736869661, "source": "界", "target": "經"}, {"weight": 1.6048820958982397, "source": "界", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "聞", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7384134885227622, "source": "聞", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.750014400201242, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "聞", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 0.7351113796589775, "source": "聞", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.5824092400461809, "source": "賢", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.585711348909966, "source": "賢", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "賢", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.2947271675944, "source": "禮", "t